This product implements the IATA ONE Record standard. The ONE Record API
specification, the ONE Record cargo ontology, the ONE Record API ontology and
the ONE Record code lists are the work of the International Air Transport
Association (IATA), published at https://github.com/IATA-Cargo/ONE-Record
under the MIT License. The generated vocabulary in src/Vocabulary/Generated is
derived from those ontologies; the generating script records the exact upstream
commit in each generated file.

NE:ONE (https://git.openlogisticsfoundation.org/wg-digitalaircargo/ne-one),
licensed under the Open Logistics Foundation License 1.3, is used only as an
external comparison oracle in the interoperability test suite. No NE:ONE source
code is included in this product. The files under tests/Interop/neone that
build it are Lambda Twelve's own.
